# Shared packages (`packages/`)

- Platform-independent code only (no React DOM or React Native UI).
- Packages: `api`, `hooks`, `types`, `utils`, `validation`, `constants`, `services`, `theme`.
- Export from each package `src/index.ts`.
- API modules call `getApiClient()` — never create ad-hoc Axios instances in apps.
- ACL must stay aligned with `backend/class/acl.js` (`@mytask/services`).
- Prefer small, composable modules over large catch-all files.
